1
00:00:01,793 --> 00:00:05,088
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:13,096 --> 00:00:14,764
[laughs]

3
00:00:32,949 --> 00:00:36,327
[Natalie] <i>If you really want</i>
<i>to help Lily Cruz,</i>

4
00:00:36,411 --> 00:00:40,457
<i>I can do whatever it is you want me to do.</i>

5
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:41,666
<i>And they'll listen.</i>

6
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:45,795
<i>Because I am their queen.</i>

7
00:00:45,879 --> 00:00:50,967
<i>I think I'll be needing you,</i>
<i>sooner than later.</i>

8
00:00:51,050 --> 00:00:52,635
<i>What do you mean Diego's missing?</i>

9
00:00:52,719 --> 00:00:54,304
<i>What does Diego have to do with this?</i>

10
00:00:54,387 --> 00:00:56,306
<i>First, Lily goes missing. Now, Diego too?</i>

11
00:00:56,389 --> 00:00:57,182
[Raul groaning]

12
00:00:57,265 --> 00:00:59,642
<i>Everyone has their secrets,</i>
<i>Raul. Deal with it!</i>

13
00:00:59,726 --> 00:01:03,980
[Julio] <i>Your mother's probably</i>
<i>being raped right now!</i>

14
00:01:04,064 --> 00:01:05,273
[Lily] <i>Your bastard!</i>

15
00:01:05,356 --> 00:01:09,277
<i>When I get out of here,</i>
<i>I swear I will kill you!</i>

16
00:01:12,447 --> 00:01:14,657
[Helena] <i>What?! Camia got away?!</i>

17
00:01:15,116 --> 00:01:16,326
<i>Lily Cruz is getting away!</i>

18
00:01:17,869 --> 00:01:18,828
[Diego] <i>Looking for this?!</i>

19
00:01:23,083 --> 00:01:24,209
[Damian] <i>Go on.</i>

20
00:01:24,709 --> 00:01:25,752
<i>Pull the damn trigger!</i>

21
00:01:25,835 --> 00:01:30,006
<i>Watch as I command Lily Cruz to lay down!</i>

22
00:01:30,089 --> 00:01:32,175
[all laughing]

23
00:01:32,258 --> 00:01:35,011
[Camia] <i>You monsters!</i>
<i>Where's my daughter?!</i>

24
00:01:35,094 --> 00:01:36,012
<i>Mom!</i>

25
00:01:36,805 --> 00:01:37,972
<i>Lily!</i>

26
00:01:39,057 --> 00:01:40,058
<i>Mom!</i>

27
00:01:49,526 --> 00:01:50,902
[Helena speaks indistinctly]

28
00:01:52,737 --> 00:01:54,447
[Helena] Hello, ladies.

29
00:01:57,033 --> 00:02:01,663
<i>I guess you already know</i>
<i>how you got yourselves into this.</i>

30
00:02:03,289 --> 00:02:04,082
<i>You</i>

31
00:02:04,582 --> 00:02:05,917
tried to escape,

32
00:02:06,626 --> 00:02:08,628
<i>and you failed miserably!</i>

33
00:02:09,254 --> 00:02:10,839
[Helena laughing]

34
00:02:13,716 --> 00:02:17,387
And it's all thanks
to my obedient soldiers.

35
00:02:18,221 --> 00:02:22,642
<i>And that dog collar you're</i>
<i>wearing around your neck, Lily.</i>

36
00:02:23,351 --> 00:02:24,853
<i>We've got you where we want you.</i>

37
00:02:24,936 --> 00:02:27,480
And you ain't going nowhere!

38
00:02:31,943 --> 00:02:33,820
Madam, there's been a new development.

39
00:02:35,488 --> 00:02:37,115
There's been a new development?

40
00:02:46,082 --> 00:02:47,167
<i>-Come on!</i>
<i>-Come on!</i>

41
00:02:47,542 --> 00:02:48,543
[Diego] <i>Come on!</i>

42
00:02:49,043 --> 00:02:50,336
Are you ready to die?!

43
00:02:50,420 --> 00:02:51,379
Do it!

44
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,967
Diego. Uncle Damian.

45
00:02:58,344 --> 00:02:59,762
[Helena] <i>Time is running out.</i>

46
00:03:00,179 --> 00:03:02,015
Do you have any surprise for me?

47
00:03:02,765 --> 00:03:03,975
Tick-tock. Tick-tock.

48
00:03:04,809 --> 00:03:06,019
Shoot me!

49
00:03:06,269 --> 00:03:09,314
[suspenseful music]

50
00:03:19,073 --> 00:03:21,075
The hell I will!

51
00:03:22,285 --> 00:03:25,204
<i>But promise me you'll let Lily go!</i>

52
00:03:25,747 --> 00:03:26,748
Diego!

53
00:03:27,415 --> 00:03:28,291
Don't!

54
00:03:30,710 --> 00:03:33,087
Oh, sure. No problem.

55
00:03:33,463 --> 00:03:35,506
[suspenseful music continues]

56
00:03:40,762 --> 00:03:42,847
Shoot me!

57
00:03:42,931 --> 00:03:43,973
[gunshot]

58
00:03:46,309 --> 00:03:47,310
[Lily] No!

59
00:03:52,732 --> 00:03:53,733
Finally!

60
00:03:54,150 --> 00:03:55,902
Helena, you monster!

61
00:03:56,236 --> 00:03:57,320
You bastards!

62
00:03:58,863 --> 00:04:00,823
[tense music playing]

63
00:04:24,472 --> 00:04:26,182
[Julio] They've finally decided.

64
00:04:26,266 --> 00:04:27,267
[Helena] Finally.

65
00:04:27,558 --> 00:04:28,977
[Helena laughs]

66
00:04:29,227 --> 00:04:30,228
What?

67
00:04:31,896 --> 00:04:32,939
[Julio] Well, well.

68
00:04:35,525 --> 00:04:36,484
Lily!

69
00:04:37,819 --> 00:04:40,488
<i>-Those are the rules.</i>
<i>-Mm-hm.</i>

70
00:04:41,197 --> 00:04:42,907
<i>Your mother dies.</i>

71
00:04:43,074 --> 00:04:44,701
No! No!

72
00:04:44,951 --> 00:04:46,953
Goodbye, Camia.

73
00:04:47,036 --> 00:04:50,039
<i>No! No! No! Do you hear me?</i>

74
00:04:50,123 --> 00:04:52,166
<i>I won't let you kill my mother!</i>

75
00:04:52,250 --> 00:04:56,754
You've reached a dead end.
Game over, Lily.

76
00:04:57,922 --> 00:05:00,383
But my darling…

77
00:05:01,467 --> 00:05:03,303
we're just starting.

78
00:05:03,386 --> 00:05:06,264
-Darling, starting. It rhymes.
-[Helena laughs]

79
00:05:06,723 --> 00:05:07,724
Papa.

80
00:05:08,808 --> 00:05:09,809
What?

81
00:05:10,101 --> 00:05:13,229
I want to see my daughter before I die.

82
00:05:13,604 --> 00:05:14,897
Where is Lily?!

83
00:05:15,523 --> 00:05:17,775
-[Camia] Lily!
-Mom, no! Mom!

84
00:05:17,859 --> 00:05:20,820
Mom, no, you won't die.
You won't die, Mom!

85
00:05:20,903 --> 00:05:22,947
<i>Spare my mother!</i>

86
00:05:24,449 --> 00:05:25,491
[Lily] <i>Please!</i>

87
00:05:26,534 --> 00:05:27,869
Just leave my mother alone, please!

88
00:05:27,952 --> 00:05:31,205
Kill me instead! Let her go!

89
00:05:31,289 --> 00:05:34,334
<i>Take me! Kill me instead!</i>

90
00:05:34,584 --> 00:05:38,713
[melancholic music playing]

91
00:05:43,384 --> 00:05:44,427
Lily!

92
00:05:48,056 --> 00:05:49,265
[Lily] No!

93
00:05:57,023 --> 00:05:58,941
No! Stop! Stop it!

94
00:05:59,025 --> 00:06:00,193
Please, that's enough!

95
00:06:04,322 --> 00:06:05,323
Mom!

96
00:06:05,782 --> 00:06:07,116
Mom! No!

97
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:09,202
[tense music playing]

98
00:06:10,411 --> 00:06:12,080
-<i>Please don't hurt…</i>
-Turn the sound off.

99
00:06:12,163 --> 00:06:13,581
-<i>my mother!</i>
-I don't want them to hear this.

100
00:06:16,667 --> 00:06:20,797
Papa, Lily Cruz has to die
before everything is over!

101
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:23,591
Turn it on. On. Hello! Mic test! Test!

102
00:06:23,674 --> 00:06:25,760
Test mic! Can they hear me?!

103
00:06:25,843 --> 00:06:26,636
Burn her!

104
00:06:26,719 --> 00:06:28,221
<i>Burn that witch!</i>

105
00:06:28,971 --> 00:06:30,556
<i>Burn her! Come on. Burn! Burn! Burn!</i>

106
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:31,474
[Helena] <i>Romulo.</i>

107
00:06:31,557 --> 00:06:33,184
-Now.
-Burn!

108
00:06:39,816 --> 00:06:41,692
[suspenseful music building]

109
00:06:46,030 --> 00:06:48,199
[gasping]

110
00:06:53,746 --> 00:06:55,665
[groaning]

111
00:06:59,210 --> 00:07:00,503
[Emilia] Yeah. I love it.

112
00:07:09,137 --> 00:07:10,513
-[mouths] Bye-bye.
-[Helena] Yes.

113
00:07:10,805 --> 00:07:11,889
-Burn that witch!
-Yes!

114
00:07:12,140 --> 00:07:13,141
Burn!

115
00:07:16,018 --> 00:07:16,936
[muffled] Help!

116
00:07:23,776 --> 00:07:25,903
[Lily groaning]

117
00:07:28,573 --> 00:07:29,657
[Emilia] No!

118
00:07:29,740 --> 00:07:31,617
-Turn it off. Turn it off.
-Wait. What are you doing?

119
00:07:31,701 --> 00:07:32,618
Shut the hell up!

120
00:07:32,702 --> 00:07:33,828
-I'm the one who kidnapped her!
-No!

121
00:07:33,911 --> 00:07:35,496
So I get to decide what to do with her.

122
00:07:35,788 --> 00:07:36,789
No. No!

123
00:07:37,331 --> 00:07:38,916
No, no… No, not like this…

124
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:40,460
You know she can't die. It's too easy.

125
00:07:40,751 --> 00:07:42,753
[Lily groaning]

126
00:07:49,927 --> 00:07:50,928
[screams]

127
00:07:51,929 --> 00:07:54,223
-Turn the audio back on.
-No.

128
00:07:54,307 --> 00:07:55,391
Romulo!

129
00:07:56,058 --> 00:07:57,059
<i>Switch it off.</i>

130
00:07:57,518 --> 00:07:58,561
No, Julio!

131
00:07:59,312 --> 00:08:00,271
No, Romulo!

132
00:08:01,022 --> 00:08:02,106
This is my playground!

133
00:08:02,190 --> 00:08:04,233
I call the shots here.
I'm in control here.

134
00:08:04,317 --> 00:08:05,485
You're not in control here.

135
00:08:10,781 --> 00:08:13,117
<i>If you're going to burn me alive…</i>

136
00:08:13,951 --> 00:08:16,120
…then just spare my mother, please!

137
00:08:16,496 --> 00:08:18,080
[Lily groaning]

138
00:08:18,498 --> 00:08:19,832
[Helena laughing]

139
00:08:19,916 --> 00:08:21,501
Oh, my, Lily!

140
00:08:22,043 --> 00:08:24,337
Do I have to smash my crown in your face

141
00:08:24,420 --> 00:08:26,797
just to remind you who the real queen is?!

142
00:08:29,175 --> 00:08:30,218
[Helena] Huh?

143
00:08:30,927 --> 00:08:34,305
<i>First, I'll kill your mother.</i>
<i>Then, I'll kill you!</i>

144
00:08:34,388 --> 00:08:35,806
No!

145
00:08:40,686 --> 00:08:42,980
Romulo, turn up the incinerator!

146
00:08:43,064 --> 00:08:44,190
<i>Romulo, now!</i>

147
00:08:44,732 --> 00:08:46,275
-Go! Burn her!
-Yes!

148
00:08:49,070 --> 00:08:50,780
-No! No!
-I said no!

149
00:08:50,863 --> 00:08:53,491
Grandpa! I said, stop this!

150
00:08:54,742 --> 00:08:56,118
-Mama…
-No! No!

151
00:08:56,202 --> 00:08:57,453
-Romulo…
-No!

152
00:08:58,329 --> 00:08:59,872
Turn the audio back on!

153
00:08:59,956 --> 00:09:00,831
-No!
-I'm talking to Ro--

154
00:09:00,915 --> 00:09:02,917
Romulo, I said…

155
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,126
<i>…stop it!</i>

156
00:09:09,799 --> 00:09:12,218
[screaming]

157
00:09:14,345 --> 00:09:16,222
[breathing raggedly]

158
00:09:25,314 --> 00:09:26,315
No, Julio!

159
00:09:27,191 --> 00:09:31,529
You, Helena, are not the only
player in this playground.

160
00:09:31,904 --> 00:09:32,905
Remember,

161
00:09:34,031 --> 00:09:35,241
we are a family.

162
00:09:35,825 --> 00:09:40,204
And we must all agree
on one final decision.

163
00:10:05,104 --> 00:10:06,105
Well?

164
00:10:06,689 --> 00:10:07,690
Are you still alive?

165
00:10:08,858 --> 00:10:10,860
[tense music playing]

166
00:10:19,201 --> 00:10:20,620
Come on, Red Dragon!

167
00:10:21,245 --> 00:10:23,998
-What more do you want?!
-[gunshots]

168
00:10:25,541 --> 00:10:27,293
Where's Lily?!

169
00:10:32,965 --> 00:10:33,966
Bravo.

170
00:10:34,634 --> 00:10:36,677
Took you long enough, but good job.

171
00:10:38,554 --> 00:10:39,847
Where's Lily?!

172
00:10:41,140 --> 00:10:43,726
I played your game. I killed Damian!

173
00:10:45,102 --> 00:10:47,188
Now bring Lily to me,
just as you promised!

174
00:10:48,397 --> 00:10:49,774
If you think she's still alive,

175
00:10:50,524 --> 00:10:51,776
then go look for her.

176
00:10:57,448 --> 00:10:58,616
I just want you to know…

177
00:11:00,368 --> 00:11:02,953
that you will never see
Lily Cruz alive again.

178
00:11:04,664 --> 00:11:06,332
-You think you're tough?
-[Diego groans]

179
00:11:18,219 --> 00:11:19,678
What the hell was that?!

180
00:11:21,389 --> 00:11:23,432
I was trying to be fair.

181
00:11:23,516 --> 00:11:26,018
[scoffs] Fair? Fair to whom, huh?

182
00:11:26,102 --> 00:11:28,521
Fair to Lily or fair to your ego?

183
00:11:30,106 --> 00:11:32,400
Didn't you hear what Arnaldo said?

184
00:11:32,483 --> 00:11:34,235
I don't want him to be part of this.

185
00:11:35,403 --> 00:11:37,488
You know what I mean.

186
00:11:37,571 --> 00:11:39,615
If you wanna be my partner,

187
00:11:39,698 --> 00:11:42,910
you have to learn to compromise.

188
00:11:43,786 --> 00:11:46,914
Helena, my dear perfect partner,

189
00:11:47,581 --> 00:11:49,542
that's not true.

190
00:11:49,625 --> 00:11:52,211
You want to know the truth, huh?

191
00:11:52,294 --> 00:11:57,716
I have a long, long list of ways
to make an enemy suffer.

192
00:11:59,093 --> 00:12:01,929
She doesn't need your fire.

193
00:12:03,222 --> 00:12:04,640
You know what we'll do?

194
00:12:04,723 --> 00:12:10,521
I'll bash her head in
until my hands give in.

195
00:12:11,188 --> 00:12:12,064
I mean…

196
00:12:13,274 --> 00:12:15,776
I mean our hands. Sorry.

197
00:12:15,860 --> 00:12:19,155
Slip of the tongue. Our hands.

198
00:12:20,614 --> 00:12:21,740
And then…

199
00:12:24,326 --> 00:12:27,246
we will mess with her brain

200
00:12:28,497 --> 00:12:34,503
until she can no longer tell
what's right from wrong.

201
00:12:36,213 --> 00:12:40,843
We will drive her insane,
as she did my grandson.

202
00:12:42,428 --> 00:12:43,387
And then what?

203
00:12:45,181 --> 00:12:48,434
And then we will be laughing
our heads off.

204
00:12:48,517 --> 00:12:52,855
Because we Ardientes
always get the last laugh.

205
00:12:52,938 --> 00:12:54,940
[laughing maniacally]

206
00:12:56,358 --> 00:12:57,943
You see? You see?

207
00:13:01,614 --> 00:13:02,656
[Julio sighs]

208
00:13:06,994 --> 00:13:09,038
You know, I should've been practicing

209
00:13:09,121 --> 00:13:10,498
my eulogy for Lily Cruz.

210
00:13:10,581 --> 00:13:12,708
But she's still alive because of you.

211
00:13:12,791 --> 00:13:15,377
She should've been burnt
to a crisp right now.

212
00:13:15,628 --> 00:13:18,422
Grandpa has made up his mind.
We can't do anything about it.

213
00:13:18,506 --> 00:13:20,591
You know he did that all for you.

214
00:13:20,674 --> 00:13:22,551
Well, my grandma is on your side.

215
00:13:23,093 --> 00:13:24,220
Because Papa…

216
00:13:24,887 --> 00:13:26,305
He keeps drilling these silly ideas

217
00:13:26,388 --> 00:13:27,556
into Mama's brain,

218
00:13:27,640 --> 00:13:31,185
like torturing Lily Cruz
first before killing her.

219
00:13:31,268 --> 00:13:34,104
Can't you guys see, huh?

220
00:13:34,188 --> 00:13:37,191
If she dies, we're all gonna be happy now!

221
00:13:38,234 --> 00:13:39,235
I was there, remember?

222
00:13:40,486 --> 00:13:43,113
I was her first victim.
I was her first target.

223
00:13:43,197 --> 00:13:46,909
I will never forget the hell
she made me go through.

224
00:13:47,868 --> 00:13:50,162
And now my memories are back,
and I'm reminded once again

225
00:13:50,246 --> 00:13:51,914
of every single thing she put me through.

226
00:13:51,997 --> 00:13:53,457
I still see and feel everything.

227
00:13:55,334 --> 00:13:57,169
[melancholic music playing]

228
00:13:59,505 --> 00:14:02,383
[Arnaldo] <i>Give me one</i>
<i>good reason to trust you.</i>

229
00:14:03,175 --> 00:14:04,343
<i>Arnaldo…</i>

230
00:14:07,304 --> 00:14:08,305
<i>I love you.</i>

231
00:14:09,265 --> 00:14:10,266
<i>And this…</i>

232
00:14:10,724 --> 00:14:11,976
<i>this is your prize.</i>

233
00:14:13,143 --> 00:14:14,144
<i>Ivy Aguas…</i>

234
00:14:16,647 --> 00:14:18,023
<i>will you marry me?</i>

235
00:14:18,107 --> 00:14:19,441
<i>Yes.</i>

236
00:14:19,525 --> 00:14:21,735
<i>Yes, Arnaldo, I will marry you.</i>

237
00:14:22,570 --> 00:14:23,571
<i>Yes!</i>

238
00:14:24,154 --> 00:14:25,364
<i>Diego is just a friend.</i>

239
00:14:25,447 --> 00:14:28,909
<i>Because I'm all yours, Arnaldo.</i>

240
00:14:29,785 --> 00:14:33,330
<i>I love you so much,</i>
<i>that's why I'm marrying you.</i>

241
00:14:34,123 --> 00:14:35,583
[priest] <i>Do you, Ivy,</i>

242
00:14:35,666 --> 00:14:39,044
<i>take Arnaldo to be</i>
<i>your lawfully wedded husband?</i>

243
00:14:39,628 --> 00:14:40,671
<i>Stop the wedding!</i>

244
00:14:43,048 --> 00:14:45,509
<i>-No, no!</i>
<i>-I don't love you! I don't love you!</i>

245
00:14:45,593 --> 00:14:49,096
<i>I'll never love a monster like you! Never!</i>

246
00:14:49,179 --> 00:14:51,307
<i>I never loved you, and I never will!</i>

247
00:14:53,058 --> 00:14:55,561
You're right, I love her.

248
00:14:57,062 --> 00:14:58,522
But I'd also love to see her beg.

249
00:15:00,608 --> 00:15:02,985
She made a complete fool of me.

250
00:15:04,236 --> 00:15:08,949
For that, I wanna see her crawl
at my feet and beg for her life!

251
00:15:11,827 --> 00:15:13,329
I want her to be my slave.

252
00:15:15,205 --> 00:15:16,457
But you, on the other hand,

253
00:15:16,540 --> 00:15:18,042
I understand…

254
00:15:18,751 --> 00:15:21,295
you're just burdened by
your loyalty to Grandma.

255
00:15:23,005 --> 00:15:25,716
But me, you, and Grandpa…

256
00:15:27,384 --> 00:15:28,761
we share the same blood.

257
00:15:30,220 --> 00:15:31,722
We all want the same thing.

258
00:15:33,515 --> 00:15:37,853
And that is to destroy Lily Cruz
and make her beg for mercy.

259
00:15:47,321 --> 00:15:48,364
[phone chimes]

260
00:15:55,287 --> 00:15:56,163
I have to go.

261
00:15:56,246 --> 00:15:57,665
Where are you off to?

262
00:15:57,748 --> 00:15:59,833
Arnaldo, where are you going?

263
00:16:01,043 --> 00:16:02,002
[sighs]

264
00:16:02,962 --> 00:16:04,964
[suspenseful music playing]

265
00:16:10,219 --> 00:16:12,638
Who disposed of Damian's body?

266
00:16:13,222 --> 00:16:15,265
Boss, Ramirez and Salazar did.

267
00:16:16,266 --> 00:16:17,893
Ramirez and Salazar? Okay.

268
00:16:19,603 --> 00:16:20,896
Boss, what should we do with him?

269
00:16:21,438 --> 00:16:23,399
Let's just kill him
before he tries to escape.

270
00:16:24,108 --> 00:16:25,359
Hold your horses.

271
00:16:26,735 --> 00:16:28,696
We need to wait for our bosses' orders.

272
00:16:29,613 --> 00:16:30,781
We'll get to that eventually.

273
00:16:31,365 --> 00:16:32,658
Just keep an eye on him,

274
00:16:32,741 --> 00:16:33,826
and don't let him get away.

275
00:16:34,034 --> 00:16:36,328
Understood? I'll call the Governor.

276
00:16:47,297 --> 00:16:48,298
[grunting]

277
00:16:49,008 --> 00:16:51,093
Let me out of here!

278
00:16:53,178 --> 00:16:55,139
You soulless criminals!

279
00:16:55,222 --> 00:16:56,849
Let me out of here!

280
00:16:57,474 --> 00:16:59,435
-Shut up! [grunts]
-[Lily groaning]

281
00:16:59,518 --> 00:17:00,477
[Lily groans]

282
00:17:02,146 --> 00:17:03,147
Shut your damn mouth!

283
00:17:11,613 --> 00:17:13,907
[breathes heavily]

284
00:17:14,575 --> 00:17:18,287
Damn you. Damn you all.

285
00:17:18,954 --> 00:17:19,997
Damn you.

286
00:17:22,374 --> 00:17:24,376
[ominous music playing]

287
00:17:42,811 --> 00:17:43,979
Where is your son going?

288
00:17:45,439 --> 00:17:46,482
I don't know, Mama.

289
00:17:47,649 --> 00:17:50,736
Sometimes, as a mother, it's
so hard for me to sort him out.

290
00:17:51,779 --> 00:17:54,990
It's Papa's fault.
He spoiled Arnaldo rotten.

291
00:17:55,657 --> 00:17:57,618
Your Papa has single-handedly

292
00:17:57,701 --> 00:18:02,289
ruined everybody else's life
here in this town.

293
00:18:02,956 --> 00:18:04,958
Mama, what are you doing here,
just standing here?

294
00:18:05,042 --> 00:18:06,710
You can't let him control everything.

295
00:18:06,794 --> 00:18:09,338
[sighs] I need a breather.

296
00:18:09,963 --> 00:18:14,551
An hour with Julio is like a year in hell!

297
00:18:15,302 --> 00:18:16,345
But be careful, Mama.

298
00:18:16,428 --> 00:18:18,764
You know that he won't think
twice about double-crossing you.

299
00:18:20,182 --> 00:18:22,017
Yes. I'm aware of that.

300
00:18:22,101 --> 00:18:23,811
And I've learned from my mistakes.

301
00:18:24,269 --> 00:18:28,607
I will never forget the hell
that he all put us through.

302
00:18:28,982 --> 00:18:31,485
He will never hurt us again.

303
00:18:32,111 --> 00:18:33,779
[tense music building]

304
00:18:38,909 --> 00:18:39,827
<i>Julio?</i>

305
00:18:40,953 --> 00:18:41,829
-[gunshot]
-[grunts]

306
00:18:43,455 --> 00:18:44,706
[doctor] <i>There's been a problem.</i>

307
00:18:44,790 --> 00:18:45,749
<i>-But I promise…</i>
<i>-My baby!</i>

308
00:18:45,833 --> 00:18:47,251
<i>…we will do everything to save your baby.</i>

309
00:18:47,334 --> 00:18:48,669
[Helena] <i>My baby! They're taking my baby!</i>

310
00:18:48,752 --> 00:18:54,341
<i>Can't you hear her crying?</i>
<i>My baby! Doc! Doc!</i>

311
00:18:54,842 --> 00:18:56,844
[melancholic music]

312
00:18:59,263 --> 00:19:00,848
When Julio took you away from me,

313
00:19:01,932 --> 00:19:04,184
he also took away my reason for living.

314
00:19:06,478 --> 00:19:08,939
I was so angry that it almost killed me!

315
00:19:11,358 --> 00:19:12,401
But on that day,

316
00:19:13,110 --> 00:19:14,695
the Red Dragon was born.

317
00:19:15,946 --> 00:19:19,867
The most fierce syndicate head
of our country.

318
00:19:20,492 --> 00:19:22,661
[sighs] Do you think

319
00:19:24,037 --> 00:19:26,290
I would still have turned out this way

320
00:19:26,999 --> 00:19:28,709
if Julio hadn't stolen you from me?

321
00:19:31,128 --> 00:19:32,337
Before he took you from me,

322
00:19:32,421 --> 00:19:35,591
all I wanted was to be a good mother.

323
00:19:36,758 --> 00:19:39,428
For us to have a simple and quiet life.

324
00:19:41,430 --> 00:19:43,390
Why are you saying these things, Mama?

325
00:19:44,266 --> 00:19:45,726
Are you starting to have regrets?

326
00:19:47,603 --> 00:19:49,563
I took everything that life threw at me.

327
00:19:50,814 --> 00:19:54,693
I could have easily chosen
to forgive, to heal,

328
00:19:55,569 --> 00:19:56,695
to bury my anger.

329
00:19:56,778 --> 00:19:58,822
But instead, I embraced that anger,

330
00:19:58,906 --> 00:20:01,617
and it's made me who I am today.

331
00:20:03,243 --> 00:20:04,453
If given a chance…

332
00:20:06,955 --> 00:20:08,165
I wouldn't change a thing.

333
00:20:09,499 --> 00:20:10,542
Because in the end…

334
00:20:13,212 --> 00:20:14,504
I found you, Emilia.

335
00:20:14,755 --> 00:20:15,839
After all these years.

336
00:20:17,674 --> 00:20:19,635
And I will never let you go again.

337
00:20:21,220 --> 00:20:22,471
I won't allow anyone…

338
00:20:23,263 --> 00:20:25,515
to ruin our lives again.

339
00:20:25,599 --> 00:20:27,100
Not that Lily Cruz!

340
00:20:27,476 --> 00:20:28,685
And certainly,

341
00:20:29,353 --> 00:20:31,939
not Julio Ardiente.

342
00:20:33,190 --> 00:20:35,192
-I love you so much.
-I love you.

343
00:20:48,622 --> 00:20:49,915
Damn you.

344
00:20:50,624 --> 00:20:51,667
Damn you all.

345
00:20:53,252 --> 00:20:54,836
[sighs]

346
00:20:56,088 --> 00:20:58,423
[Diego] <i>What if something happens</i>
<i>tomorrow or the day after?</i>

347
00:20:58,507 --> 00:21:01,134
<i>What if we don't get our</i>
<i>happily ever after?</i>

348
00:21:01,218 --> 00:21:03,428
<i>Diego, don't say that.</i>

349
00:21:03,512 --> 00:21:06,390
<i>Lily, we can't know for sure.</i>
<i>You know that.</i>

350
00:21:06,890 --> 00:21:08,558
<i>We don't know what the future holds.</i>

351
00:21:08,642 --> 00:21:10,394
<i>But we have tonight.</i>

352
00:21:11,228 --> 00:21:13,563
<i>Lily Cruz, will you marry me?</i>

353
00:21:14,398 --> 00:21:15,399
<i>Yes, Diego.</i>

354
00:21:16,316 --> 00:21:17,526
<i>I will marry you.</i>

355
00:21:18,318 --> 00:21:19,403
[Camia] <i>Lily!</i>

356
00:21:19,945 --> 00:21:20,821
<i>Mom!</i>

357
00:21:20,904 --> 00:21:21,905
<i>Lily!</i>

358
00:21:25,200 --> 00:21:26,868
-<i>Diego!</i>
-[Camia] <i>Lily!</i>

359
00:21:32,499 --> 00:21:35,294
I will get you.

360
00:21:39,298 --> 00:21:42,050
I will kill you all.

361
00:21:46,054 --> 00:21:48,724
[suspenseful music building]

362
00:22:05,157 --> 00:22:07,159
[suspenseful music playing]

363
00:22:36,646 --> 00:22:38,065
<i>I will find you</i>

364
00:22:38,940 --> 00:22:40,275
<i>and your mother, Lily.</i>

365
00:22:41,109 --> 00:22:44,988
<i>I won't give up until I get you</i>
<i>away from the Ardientes.</i>

366
00:22:49,409 --> 00:22:52,037
Anna. Anna, wait up.

367
00:22:53,538 --> 00:22:55,165
I'm sorry for what I said.

368
00:22:56,166 --> 00:22:58,126
And… you're right.

369
00:22:58,210 --> 00:23:01,254
We need to work together
in order to find Lily and Diego.

370
00:23:01,797 --> 00:23:02,923
Thank you, Marlon.

371
00:23:03,840 --> 00:23:04,841
[Arnaldo] Anna?

372
00:23:05,425 --> 00:23:07,135
Arnaldo, what are you doing here?

373
00:23:07,219 --> 00:23:09,387
I heard about what happened to Lily.

374
00:23:09,471 --> 00:23:10,764
Do you know anything?

375
00:23:12,557 --> 00:23:17,062
I'm not sure because I haven't
seen Grandpa, Mama, and Grandma.

376
00:23:17,145 --> 00:23:18,146
What?

377
00:23:18,730 --> 00:23:21,733
Do you think they kidnapped
Auntie Camia and Lily?

378
00:23:22,734 --> 00:23:24,111
I have no doubt

379
00:23:24,194 --> 00:23:25,779
that the Ardientes are behind it.

380
00:23:26,446 --> 00:23:29,574
You can't trust that man, Anna.
He's an Ardiente too.

381
00:23:30,951 --> 00:23:32,410
[Marlon] Come on, Mister Danny.

382
00:23:32,494 --> 00:23:35,747
We all know Arnaldo's changed.

383
00:23:37,207 --> 00:23:39,584
[Danny] Fine.
If you really are a changed man,

384
00:23:40,168 --> 00:23:43,296
then go look for Lily and the Ardientes.

385
00:23:43,797 --> 00:23:46,091
If you don't, we'll just have to
scour the forest ourselves.

386
00:23:46,716 --> 00:23:49,344
Because we heard that's
where they were last seen.

387
00:23:50,303 --> 00:23:52,055
It's dangerous, what you're planning.

388
00:23:52,806 --> 00:23:57,185
Please don't go unarmed.
It's risky out there.

389
00:23:58,311 --> 00:24:00,772
But I'll call Mama.
It's the least I can do to help.

390
00:24:02,941 --> 00:24:04,025
[Marlon] Calm down.

391
00:24:12,617 --> 00:24:15,120
[suspenseful music playing]

392
00:24:27,716 --> 00:24:30,927
Ah, as usual, Mama isn't picking up.

393
00:24:32,304 --> 00:24:33,555
But don't worry.

394
00:24:34,598 --> 00:24:37,225
I will find Lily
and that bastard who took her.

395
00:24:38,101 --> 00:24:40,020
I promise you, I'll bring her back.

396
00:25:10,217 --> 00:25:11,218
[metal clanking]

397
00:25:11,676 --> 00:25:12,677
<i>Mom.</i>

398
00:25:16,556 --> 00:25:20,477
[action music playing]

399
00:25:44,251 --> 00:25:45,794
<i>Mom. I'll save you.</i>

400
00:25:46,544 --> 00:25:48,046
<i>I'm coming, Mom.</i>

401
00:25:52,759 --> 00:25:54,344
<i>I'll save you.</i>

402
00:26:08,358 --> 00:26:10,360
[action music playing]

403
00:26:41,850 --> 00:26:43,977
[tense music playing]

404
00:27:11,046 --> 00:27:12,047
Mom?

405
00:27:16,676 --> 00:27:17,677
Mom?

406
00:27:18,219 --> 00:27:19,220
Mom.

407
00:27:21,222 --> 00:27:22,599
-Mom!
-Lily.

408
00:27:23,308 --> 00:27:24,893
[suspenseful music]

409
00:27:27,562 --> 00:27:28,563
Mom.

410
00:27:30,523 --> 00:27:31,816
-Lily.
-Mom.

411
00:27:33,151 --> 00:27:34,152
Mom.

412
00:27:42,035 --> 00:27:43,036
Mom.

413
00:27:45,830 --> 00:27:48,458
Mom, are you okay? Did they hurt you?

414
00:27:50,835 --> 00:27:51,836
I promise you, Mom.

415
00:27:52,545 --> 00:27:53,505
I'll do all I can.

416
00:27:53,588 --> 00:27:56,633
We'll get out of here. I'll save you, Mom.

417
00:27:58,593 --> 00:28:01,012
How, Lily?

418
00:28:02,639 --> 00:28:04,641
Will we ever get out of here?

419
00:28:06,893 --> 00:28:08,728
How will we even escape?

420
00:28:10,146 --> 00:28:11,439
How, Lily?

421
00:28:12,190 --> 00:28:13,191
Mom.

422
00:28:13,733 --> 00:28:16,611
[dramatic music]

423
00:28:22,117 --> 00:28:23,118
Mom?

424
00:28:25,161 --> 00:28:26,162
Mom?

425
00:28:26,538 --> 00:28:27,664
Mom?

426
00:28:28,331 --> 00:28:29,416
Mom!

427
00:28:29,499 --> 00:28:31,251
[music intensifies]

428
00:28:32,210 --> 00:28:33,837
[music fades]

429
00:28:39,509 --> 00:28:40,510
Mom?

430
00:28:41,010 --> 00:28:42,679
[somber music building]

431
00:28:45,557 --> 00:28:46,558
Mom?

432
00:29:02,615 --> 00:29:03,616
Mom?

433
00:29:07,078 --> 00:29:08,496
Mom, can you hear me?

434
00:29:09,080 --> 00:29:10,081
Mom?

435
00:29:10,331 --> 00:29:11,332
Mom!

436
00:29:17,464 --> 00:29:18,465
Lily!

437
00:29:18,923 --> 00:29:19,883
Lily!

438
00:29:19,966 --> 00:29:20,967
Mom!

439
00:29:21,801 --> 00:29:22,802
Lily!

440
00:29:26,973 --> 00:29:29,309
Mom! Just talk to me, please!

441
00:29:29,392 --> 00:29:30,852
I can hear you!

442
00:29:32,187 --> 00:29:33,188
Lily!

443
00:29:33,480 --> 00:29:34,522
Lily!

444
00:29:35,148 --> 00:29:36,232
Lily!

445
00:29:37,066 --> 00:29:38,151
I'm here, Mom.

446
00:29:39,694 --> 00:29:41,571
I'm on the other side.

447
00:29:51,372 --> 00:29:52,373
Mom?

448
00:29:52,665 --> 00:29:54,584
Mom, are you okay? Mom?

449
00:29:55,126 --> 00:29:56,669
Mom, did they hurt you?

450
00:29:56,753 --> 00:29:58,463
Did they give you something to eat?

451
00:30:00,131 --> 00:30:01,216
No, Lily.

452
00:30:01,716 --> 00:30:02,759
How about you?

453
00:30:03,968 --> 00:30:05,303
Are you sure you're okay?

454
00:30:06,346 --> 00:30:09,015
I haven't lost hope, Mom.

455
00:30:11,559 --> 00:30:14,562
I promise I will save you, Mom.
Did you hear that?

456
00:30:15,188 --> 00:30:17,106
I'll save you!

457
00:30:18,817 --> 00:30:20,610
I trust you, Lily.

458
00:30:21,820 --> 00:30:24,614
I know we can make it out of here.

459
00:30:26,199 --> 00:30:27,075
Lily…

460
00:30:27,700 --> 00:30:31,913
if this were all a dream,
I'd be the one to save you.

461
00:30:33,039 --> 00:30:34,499
But that's just not how it is.

462
00:30:36,918 --> 00:30:40,588
There are cameras watching us
every second of the day.

463
00:30:42,298 --> 00:30:43,091
Lily…

464
00:30:43,174 --> 00:30:46,177
How? Will we ever see each other again?

465
00:30:49,222 --> 00:30:51,099
Yes, we will, Mom!

466
00:30:53,059 --> 00:30:54,185
I have a plan.

467
00:30:55,311 --> 00:30:56,771
<i>I have a plan.</i>

468
00:30:57,647 --> 00:30:58,648
Ah.

469
00:30:59,524 --> 00:31:01,693
I still don't understand
why you're so happy

470
00:31:01,776 --> 00:31:04,404
with what we're doing.
We are wasting our time.

471
00:31:06,573 --> 00:31:07,574
Helena.

472
00:31:08,950 --> 00:31:12,120
They say that time you enjoy wasting…

473
00:31:12,787 --> 00:31:15,373
is not wasted time.

474
00:31:15,623 --> 00:31:16,457
And besides,

475
00:31:17,584 --> 00:31:19,878
I'm sure you'll
find all this entertaining.

476
00:31:19,961 --> 00:31:20,962
Ugh!

477
00:31:21,296 --> 00:31:22,922
Another one of your clichés.

478
00:31:25,550 --> 00:31:30,471
<i>Mom, I know they can hear us,</i>
<i>but I don't care!</i>

479
00:31:31,681 --> 00:31:33,683
<i>I don't give a damn anymore!</i>

480
00:31:34,893 --> 00:31:36,561
[tense music playing]

481
00:31:36,644 --> 00:31:38,855
-[metal clanking]
-[Lily groaning]

482
00:31:40,315 --> 00:31:41,691
Ardientes!

483
00:31:43,026 --> 00:31:44,360
I know you can hear me!

484
00:31:45,570 --> 00:31:47,155
And what is she doing, Papa?

485
00:31:48,239 --> 00:31:49,532
She's losing it.

486
00:31:50,658 --> 00:31:53,161
-She's going crazy.
-Hey, that's not nice.

487
00:31:53,244 --> 00:31:54,621
[Julio and Arnaldo laughing]

488
00:31:54,704 --> 00:31:56,080
Sorry, my son.

489
00:31:56,831 --> 00:31:59,667
-[Lily continues groaning]
-[metal clanking]

490
00:32:02,086 --> 00:32:04,339
[Camia] <i>Lily. Don't.</i>

491
00:32:05,173 --> 00:32:06,174
Lily!

492
00:32:06,799 --> 00:32:08,509
[Lily groaning]

493
00:32:09,010 --> 00:32:10,136
[Lily] Well?!

494
00:32:10,219 --> 00:32:12,847
-[metal clanking]
-[Lily groaning]

495
00:32:16,225 --> 00:32:19,395
<i>Come and get me, you bastards!</i>

496
00:32:19,479 --> 00:32:21,147
[Lily continues groaning]

497
00:32:23,107 --> 00:32:25,068
<i>Ardientes!</i>

498
00:32:25,401 --> 00:32:27,028
<i>Can you hear me?!</i>

499
00:32:27,111 --> 00:32:29,530
<i>I know you're watching me!</i>

500
00:32:29,906 --> 00:32:31,616
-Yeah.
-[Lily groaning]

501
00:32:31,699 --> 00:32:34,702
<i>Well?! Show yourselves!</i>

502
00:32:34,994 --> 00:32:38,331
<i>Come out and face me, you cowards!</i>

503
00:32:39,290 --> 00:32:41,000
I love challenges like this.

504
00:32:42,210 --> 00:32:43,795
-[Lily groaning]
-[Julio clears throat]

505
00:32:44,170 --> 00:32:45,254
Romulo.

506
00:32:45,755 --> 00:32:46,756
[Lily] <i>Well?!</i>

507
00:32:48,967 --> 00:32:51,052
-[Lily continues groaning]
-[metal clanking]

508
00:32:52,762 --> 00:32:53,763
[Lily groaning]

509
00:32:59,102 --> 00:33:01,062
[tense music playing]

510
00:33:14,325 --> 00:33:15,326
[groans]

511
00:33:28,756 --> 00:33:30,466
-[man 1] Boss.
-[man 2] Boss.

512
00:33:31,718 --> 00:33:33,344
Ramirez and Salazar should be here by now.

513
00:33:33,428 --> 00:33:34,470
Where are they?

514
00:33:34,554 --> 00:33:36,305
They probably went off
to their girlfriends.

515
00:33:36,389 --> 00:33:38,474
Don't start with me.
I'm not in the mood for jokes.

516
00:33:42,603 --> 00:33:43,563
[Magbanua] Oh.

517
00:33:43,646 --> 00:33:44,856
[laughs]

518
00:33:45,314 --> 00:33:47,692
Our guest is finally awake.

519
00:33:49,110 --> 00:33:50,028
